{"articleNo":"96500","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=96500&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2014학년도 1학기 재입학 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2013.12.10","hit":"6866","attachments":[{"name":"재입학 신청서류 서식.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=96500&attachNo=3120"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt; FONT-FAMILY: 'HY울릉도M'; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #000080; TEXT-DECORATION: underline; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\">2014학년도 1학기 재입학 안내문</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 'HY강M'; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #990000; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\">1. 재입학 대상</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"> <span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">: </span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\">재학 중 자퇴, 미등록, 미복학 및 학사경고 누적 등의 사유로 제적된 자</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 8pt; FONT-FAMILY: 'HY강M'; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #990000; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\">2. 재입학 자격 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #990000; TEXT-DECORATION: underline; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\">제한</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 41pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-INDENT: -41pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. </span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\">학생활동 등으로 제적된 자 중 개전의 정이 없는 자</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 학사경고로 제적된 후 1년(2학기)이 경과되지 아니한 자</span></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;→</span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\">학사경고제적 1년 경과 후 재입학 가능</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 수학능력과 수업태도 등 학업활동을 계속할 수 없다고 판단되는 자</span></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;라. 재입학 사실이 있는 자</span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\">→</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\">재입학은 1회에 한함</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;마. 징계에 의하여 제적된 자 및 재학연한 초과자(재학연한은 수업연한의 2배)</span></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 8pt; FONT-FAMILY: 'HY강M'; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #990000; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\">3. 재입학 신청 일정</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #000099; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\">재입학원서 접수기간 및 신청장소</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;: 2014.01.15.(수)~01.17.(금)</span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #000080; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\">해당 종합학사행정실</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. </span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #000080; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\">재입학 허가일(예정) : 2014.01.28.(화)</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - </span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\">합격자 조회는 ‘원스톱서비스-학적부-학적자료조회’에서 확인 가능</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 36pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-INDENT: -36pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; -&nbsp;</span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\">재입학 합격자 중 휴학 신청을 원하는 학생도 등록을 완료하여야 하며,</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 36pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-INDENT: -36pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 2014.03.03.(월) </span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\">개강 이후에 휴학 신청 가능</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp; </span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\">다. 수강신청 기간</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; -&nbsp;</span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">2014.02.11.(화)~02.12.(수) 1학년, 4학년 이상</span></span></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; -&nbsp;</span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">2014.02.13.(목)~02.14.(금) 2학년, 3학년</span></span></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;&nbsp;라. 등록 기간 : 2014.02.24.(월)~02.27.(목)</span></span></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"></span></span></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #990000; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\">4. 재입학 여석 산출인원 : 총53명</span></p><!--StartFragment--><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">재입학은 제적 당시의 학년, 학부(과, 전공)로 허가함</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. </span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; TEXT-DECORATION: underline; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\">모집단위 폐지된 학부(과)의 경우 학칙이 정하는 모집단위에 재입학 허가</span></p><!--StartFragment--><p class=\"HStyle0\"></p><table style=\"BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: medium n